Package: mini-commander
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: very simplified Midnight Commander clone with viewer and editor
 Mini Commander is a small two-panel file manager for the Linux terminal.
 It includes a built-in file viewer and a text editor with syntax
 highlighting, block operations and UTF-8 support.
 .
 The binary is installed as mini-commander to avoid a conflict with
 Midnight Commander's mc.
